{"id": "119948", "name": "אי-שוויון עם ערך מוחלט וחזקה רביעית – |c − 2x⁴| ≤ d (א)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>פתרו את אי השוויון הבא</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\left| {{CT:0}} - 2{{CT:1}}^4 \\right| \\le {{CT:2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>הציגו את תשובתכם כסדרת אי-שוויונים מקושרים בקשרים לוגיים. כמו לדוגמא <span dir=\"ltr\"><code>x&gt;=5</code> and/or <code>x&lt;13</code></span>.</p><p>תשובתכם:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> משתמשים בכלל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(|u|\\le b \\iff -b\\le u\\le b\\)</span>, מבודדים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^4\\)</span>, ואז מוציאים שורש רביעי (זכרו ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> יכול להיות שלילי).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הסרת הערך המוחלט</b><br>מאחר ו<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:3}}. \\]</p>אז<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}} \\le {{CT:5}}\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}} \\ge {{CT:6}}.\\)</span></p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — בידוד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^4\\)</span></b><br>ולכן<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}} \\le {{CT:5}}+{{CT:8}}\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}} \\ge {{CT:6}}+{{CT:8}}.\\)</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}} \\le {{CT:9}}\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}} \\ge {{CT:10}}.\\)</span></p>חלוקה ב-2 נותנת<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:11}} \\le {{CT:12}}\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:11}} \\ge {{CT:13}}.\\)</span></p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — שורש רביעי</b><br>נוציא שורש רביעי<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\ge -{{CT:14}}\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}\\le {{CT:14}}\\)</span> וגם (<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}} \\ge {{CT:15}}\\)</span> או <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}} \\le -{{CT:15}}\\)</span>)</p>תשובה זו ניתן להזין כך<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">(\\({{CT:1}}&gt;={{CT:16}}\\) and \\({{CT:1}}&lt;=-1\\)) or (\\({{CT:1}}&gt;= 1\\) and \\({{CT:1}}&lt;={{CT:17}}\\))</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה, יפה מאוד</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה חלקית</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span class=\"incorrect\">תשובה שגויה</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 40, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["c1", "c2", "correctanswer", "correctanswer2", "n1", "p", "v", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 4}